    "source": {
      "value": "pc2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "In your youth, you galloped on horseback over vast prairies, serving as a vanguard for your settlement, an army, or another group. Seeing so many different lands built a thirst in you to adventure and explore the world instead of just racing past it.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Nature skill and the Plains Lore skill. You gain the Express Rider skill feat."
    },
